								<br />
								<a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?action=profile;u=975"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</div>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3194.msg36245#msg36245"><img src="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/Themes/safgrey105/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=3194.msg36245#msg36245">iran contra</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> September 01, 2007, 08:30:45 pm &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							<div style="overflow: auto; width: 100%;">i&#039;ve been doing some reading and research on latin american development, and came across these on the iran contra cover up.<br /><br />i figured while we were on the documentary posting spree i&#039;d throw them up.<br /><br />this is a bill moyers doccumentary on the specific iran contra affair and the history of us covert ops in general.<br /><br /><a href="http&#58;//video.google.com/videoplay?docid=3505348655137118430&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=282&amp;start=0&amp;num=10&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=3" target="_blank">http://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=3505348655137118430&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=282&amp;start=0&amp;num=10&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=3</a><br /><br />this one&#039;s in 3 parts but is pretty good too.&nbsp; its more on the parts of the scandal that didn&#039;t come out in the official record.<br /><a href="http&#58;//video.google.com/videoplay?docid=4755829652615170641&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=284&amp;start=0&amp;num=20&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=1" target="_blank">http://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=4755829652615170641&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=284&amp;start=0&amp;num=20&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=1</a><br /><br /><a href="http&#58;//video.google.com/videoplay?docid=-6363522851504883872&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=284&amp;start=0&amp;num=20&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=6" target="_blank">http://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=-6363522851504883872&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=284&amp;start=0&amp;num=20&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=6</a><br /><br /><a href="http&#58;//video.google.com/videoplay?docid=-8622796487067551025&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=284&amp;start=0&amp;num=20&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=9" target="_blank">http://video.google.com/videoplay?docid=-8622796487067551025&amp;q=iran+contra&amp;total=284&amp;start=0&amp;num=20&amp;so=0&amp;type=search&amp;plindex=9</a><br /><br />anybody know of a good one that goes more in depth into the drug trade aspects of it?&nbsp; i&#039;ve found a couple books that get into that relationship and how it related to the subversion of the black panthers, but not much audio video online.<br /><br />also democracy now has a whole set of different reports on iran-contra and on most of the rest of regan&#039;s crimes here<br /><a href="http&#58;//www.democracynow.org/static/flashback.shtml" target="_blank">http://www.democracynow.org/static/flashback.shtml</a></div>
						</td>
					</tr>
